  "body": "Positioned in the highly sought-after Arran Point, this impressive four-bedroom home delivers the space, quality and lifestyle that discerning buyers are searching for. Surrounded by executive homes and moments from the estuary walkway, local schools and parks, this is an opportunity to secure a substantial family home in a location that continues to attract attention.\r\n\r\nWith generous proportions, high-quality finishes, stunning views and all-day sun, this home deserves your attention. If you've been searching for a property that offers the complete package, now is the time to take a closer look.\r\n\r\n**Attention Agents: Bring your buyers - we offer competitive conjunctional rates to all agencies.**\r\n\r\nDesigned for modern family living, this beautifully presented home combines high ceilings, sun-filled interiors and a thoughtful floor plan that balances shared living with private spaces. The executive kitchen sits at the heart of the home, overlooking the open-plan dining and living areas, with sliding doors opening to the sunny deck for effortless indoor-outdoor entertaining.\r\n\r\nProperty features include:\r\n*\tFour generous double bedrooms plus a study nook, including a private primary suite with walk-in wardrobe and ensuite\r\n*\tExecutive kitchen with extensive storage, generous bench space, double ovens, built-in microwave, warming drawer and drinks fridge\r\n*\tSpacious open-plan dining and living areas flowing seamlessly to the outdoor deck\r\n*\tGuest powder room for added convenience\r\n*\tStunning views and all-day sunshine\r\n*\tDucted air-conditioning and engineered timber flooring\r\n*\tDouble internal-access garage with built-in laundry, additional storage and EV charging wiring\r\n\r\n**Space, Privacy and Flexibility for the Whole Family**\r\nThe thoughtfully designed layout places the primary suite away from the remaining three bedrooms, creating a private retreat while providing plenty of room for children, teenagers or visiting guests. Whether you're entertaining friends, enjoying a quiet afternoon on the deck or bringing the family together around the kitchen, this home offers the versatility to suit your lifestyle.\r\n\r\n**Do you need to sell in order to purchase? There may be some flexibility with this listing - get in touch to discuss options.**\r\n\r\nArran Point is one of Millwater's desirable neighbourhoods, offering an appealing blend of lifestyle and convenience. Enjoy walks along the nearby estuary, easy access to local schools including Orewa Primary, Kingsway Junior and Senior and Orewa Colllege, cafes, shops and parks, plus Silverdale's shopping centre and the boutique offerings of Orewa just a short drive away.\r\n\r\n**Our Vendors Are Motivated - Make Your Move!**\r\n\r\nOffering space, sunshine, quality finishes, impressive views and an outstanding location, this is a home that deserves to be at the top of your viewing list. With motivated Vendors ready to move forward, now is the time to arrange your viewing and explore the possibilities.\r\n\r\nContact Sarah today for further information or visit one of our advertised open homes this weekend. Your next move could start here.",
